+// With the nx-mobile link, the frontend chooses the ad hoc server and starts this device's when it should, so the
+// options that would choose one here are overridden. The port offset is the same on every device (each socket binds
+// at the game's port plus it), and not 0: Android refuses the ports under 1024 some games use.
